OL,3,AHeathrow and Gatwick among airports hit
OL,4,Aby air traffic control problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FDepartures from a number of UK
OL,7,Fairports, including Heathrow and
OL,8,FGatwick, have been affected by a
OL,9,Ftechnical problem affecting the air
OL,10,Ftraffic control provider Nats.
OL,12,FAt Heathrow, departures were initially
OL,13,Fpaused around lunchtime. Traffic then
OL,14,Fresumed, before facing further
OL,15,Fstop-start disruption in the afternoon.
OL,16,FIncoming flights have been landing as
OL,17,Fnormal.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
