OL,3,AHeathrow and Gatwick among airports hit
OL,4,Aby air traffic control problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FGatwick said it was currently being
OL,7,Faffected by the issue, along with other
OL,8,Fairports. East Midlands has also been
OL,9,Faffected by the issue, while Manchester
OL,10,FAirport warned that some departing
OL,11,Fflights could be delayed.
OL,13,FPassengers have been advised to contact
OL,14,Ftheir airlines to check the status of
OL,15,Ftheir flights.
